# Delivering the Goods past its steps (task 7 mutants): a GM's Prog 2 is neither the quest's Prog 0 nor its Prog 1:
# Fochacha, Qutiba and Ulamaal answer nothing of the quest (no script of theirs plays: onTrigger returns -1).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Fochacha/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Qutiba/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Ulamaal/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=2.897,0,-10.781 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.DeliveringTheGoods accepted
charvar Quest[6][61]Prog 2
login
trigger Fochacha                        # Prog 2: nil (not the 41 of Prog 1)
finish-if-event
trigger Qutiba                          # nil (not the 52 of Prog 1)
finish-if-event
trigger Ulamaal                         # nil (not the 53 of Prog 1)
finish-if-event
